# Narrow LF guard on TypeScript source (D-07).
# newLine:lf in packages/angular-typechecker/tsconfig.lib.json is the PRIMARY emit
# guard for the shipped bin.js shebang; this is belt-and-suspenders on the SOURCE so
# the committed *.ts never carries CRLF on the Windows build host. Deliberately NOT a
# repo-wide `* text=auto eol=lf` renormalization (would churn the committed
# ng-cli-workspace fixture + lockfiles).
*.ts text eol=lf
